==============================================================================
LRC section check-off and switch atlas
==============================================================================
Canonical gauge: include speed 0 and divide the loop into n fixed sections.
Dream certificate: perfect matching in runner<->section lonely-witness graph.
Exotic cases reduce to Hall packets plus section-support tournaments.

